            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.26</h2>
<ul>
<li>Settings → Focus: set your working day on a bar you drag, from 05:00 to 23:00 — days can now run longer than eight hours.</li>
<li>One "Morning digest" switch: a banner with your day and a soft chime, the first time you sit down each morning.</li>
<li>Meeting Notes uses the same white icon as the rest of Settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
